  (text "- Q701 ship FET (S = CHG_BAT, D = VBAT_PACK), gate from SDRV via R709 0R. Firmware: SFET_PRESENT = 1, EN_BATOC = 1 (9.3 A IBAT_OCP). /QON: SW701 or UI power button (J501 pin 20) -> 1 s exits ship mode, 10 s reset"
    (at 30.48 234.95 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c0fa50a0-2f74-4d53-a594-4f887f4a7019")
  )
  (text "- DNP: C719 (BATP filter, 4S only), C720 (SFET gate-drain slow-start), R710 (SFET gate-source), C721 (SFET gate-source cap, value set at bring-up). TP703 = SFET_G probe"
    (at 30.48 238.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "aae47aba-a0be-44f7-9db0-c482982b8769")
  )
  (text "- C720 (gate–drain) may be fitted only together with C721 ≥ 5 × C720 or with R710 (ECO-002 / S2); otherwise hot-plug couples SFET_G high and Q701 turns on into the PVDD bulk"
    (at 30.48 242.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e57df4e0-07cf-4e1a-92a7-c2101d8ff1b1")
  )
  (text "- PROG R701 8.2k 1% -> 2S, fsw 750 kHz (requires L701 = 2.2 uH). POR: VREG 8.4 V, VSYSMIN 7.0 V; POR/watchdog ICHG = 2 A (BQ25792, 2S); firmware sets ICHG at boot"
    (at 30.48 215.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0db08632-a100-4f16-a0a2-4e2bc63434bb")
  )
